.TH ckman-oath-reset 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-oath\-reset \- Delete all OATH accounts and the OATH password
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-oath\-reset\fR [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete all OATH accounts and the OATH password
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Do not ask for confirmation
.TP
\fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR \fI<PIN>\fR
CanoKey Admin PIN (prompted when omitted)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
